    "measurementTechnique": [
      "Soil cores were collected from the centers of a LCP and HCP beneath two different vegetation covers (dominant aboveground vegetation). Cores were shipped on ice and stored frozen at -80degC until processing. Each core was sectioned into 5-cm depth increments using a band saw, and then thawed and homogenized by hand. Soil water extractions were used to isolate low molecular weight organics from soil matrix and core sections were also sub-sampled for TC/TN measurements. Extracts were analyzed by reversed-phase and hydrophilic interaction nano-liquid chromatography coupled with electrospray ionization and high-resolution Orbitrap mass spectrometry."
    ],
